NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000419 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000420 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000421 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000422 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000423 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000424 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000425 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000426 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000427 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000428 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000429 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000430 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000431 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000432 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000433 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000434 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000435 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
